        </div><div class="ac-card" style="border-left: 4px solid #EBCAFF"><div class="ac-meta">Created by Jane Doe &nbsp;|&nbsp; 02/03/2026</div><div class="ac-pgbar"><a href="#page-1-2" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none;">P 1.2/09:30 &ndash; 1.2/09:30</a></div><div class="ac-lines"><div class="ac-line">
              <span class="ac-ln">2</span>
              <span class="ac-ts">09:30</span>
